SF0092 Make carbon dioxide great again-no net zero.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Steinmetz and Representative(s) Bear
AN ACT relating to environmental quality; providing legislative findings;
specifying that carbon dioxide is not a pollutant and is a beneficial substance;
providing policy statements of the state associated with carbon dioxide;
repealing low-carbon energy standard requirements; repealing conflicting
provisions; making conforming amendments; specifying applicability; requiring
reimbursement to utility customers as specified; requiring rulemaking; and
providing for an effective date.
